== Not distributed ==

EQDeeps reads the player's own EverQuest install — spell files, map files,
item data (see docs/domain/eq-client-files.md) — in place. None of it is
copied into this repository or into a release, and `--no-spells` stops the app
reading any of it. Mob detail fetched from EQLBase (ADR-020) is cached under
%AppData% on the machine that asked for it and is never bundled; `--no-reference`
switches that off.

